
 \mytriangle{red} Here you can learn how to find polynomial roots using a web app:
 \begin{solutionbox} \begin{center}\bf{Polynomial roots with Alpertron}\end{center}\begin{enumerate}[label=\protect\circled{\color{white}\arabic*}]
\item \begin{bf}Step one:\end{bf} Go to the website \href{https://www.alpertron.com.ar/POLFACT.HTM}{www.alpertron.com.ar/POLFACT.HTM}
 \item \begin{bf}Step two:\end{bf} Type the polynomial using the symbol \^{} to write powers and press factor to get the roots.
\item \begin{bf}Step three:\end{bf} Change the sign on the factors obtained in order to obtain the roots.
 \end{enumerate}
\end{solutionbox}
